<title>USA: Maxwell, Yahoo! in alliance.</title>
<headline>Maxwell, Yahoo! in alliance.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxwell Laboratories, Inc. and Yahoo! Inc said they have agreed to establish a co-branded real-time traffic service in major U.S. metropolitan areas as part of Yahoo!'s community-oriented regional sites providing up-to-the-minute information.</p>
<p>Yahoo! launched its series of regional sites in June with Yahoo! San Franscisco Bay Area www.sfbay.yahoo.com.</p>
<p>Maxwell is providing co-branded traffic information to Yahoo! for Los Angeles, Orange and San Diego counties in conjunction with Yahoo! Los Angeles, which was unveiled earlier this week.</p>
